<title>USA: Harrah's Sept 30 Q3 shr falls to $0.41.</title>
<headline>Harrah's Sept 30 Q3 shr falls to $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.41		    $0.50</p>
<p> Net		 42,350		   51,310</p>
<p> Revs		429,201		  425,824</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  103,324		  103,347</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.00		    $1.12</p>
<p> Net		 103,737		  115,393</p>
<p> Revs		1,213,523		1,171,642</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  103,450		  103,209</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Harrah's Entertainment Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said third quarter 1996 earnings included about a $0.02 per share charge due to reorganization of its New Orleans project. The third quarter 1995 included about a $0.07 per share gain from the sale of a part of the company's equity interest in Harrah's Sky City in New Zealand.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
